    <criterion id="6">Impact results are logged in knowledge/log.md with the source node, number of flagged nodes, and severity breakdown</criterion>
    <criterion id="7">Impact propagation runs as part of every compilation step (story, epic, deployment, and pre-dev)</criterion>
